### Tripwire counters by class

From each boot's last complete `[tripwire]` line (the `tw_*` columns of `summary.tsv`). A cell is "boots with a non-zero value / sum over those boots", or "/ max" for a gauge (marked max). A per-CPU key's row without an index sums its CPUs. Values that are 0 in every boot are left out.

